      "statement": "Under the FY2025 as-of snapshot, the NII Sensitivity Model's base-case 12-month NII is 50,236.91 $mm, and the -200 bp parallel shock yields projected NII of 47,220.02 $mm, a change of -3,016.89 $mm (-0.0601, about -6.01%); -100 bp yields 48,728.47 (-1,508.44, -3.00%), +100 bp yields 51,745.35 (+1,508.44), and +200 bp yields 53,253.80 (+3,016.89, +6.01%).",
