    {
      "id": "claim_6fc72c4cf43d4cc896ae45f40b322898",
      "statement": "Each balance-sheet line's NII effect equals sign (asset +1, liability -1) x balance x beta x repricing factor x shock_bp/10000, where the repricing factor counts only the 0-3m bucket (repriced at month 1.5) and 3-12m bucket (month 7.5) over a 12-month horizon, i.e. 0.875 x share(0-3m) + 0.375 x share(3-12m); the 1-5y and >5y buckets do not affect NII.",
