      "statement": "At -200 bp, asset lines lose about 11,638.44 $mm while liability lines gain 8,621.55 $mm (wholesale deposits +4,060.80, consumer deposits +2,623.05, repo +1,417.50, long-term debt +520.20, noninterest-bearing 0); the largest asset effects are deposits with banks -4,320.75, C&I loans -2,458.12 and credit cards -1,584.68, so the balance sheet is asset-sensitive and the down shock is the adverse earnings case.",
